/P 87 0 R
/E (GigE Vision leads the industry in terms of market share thanks to its long-distance reach, bandwidth scalability, native IPC interface, and cost-effective cabling. While its already larger cameras, thermal footprints, and cost for 1 Gbps systems are generally acceptable, at higher bandwidths these present significant challenges.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
