/E (The VA7000 also delivers several economic and design complexity benefits through component cost reduction. For example, the chipset eliminates the need for FPGAs in cameras, enabling smaller, simpler, and more cost-effective devices. In addition, power consumption also decreases compared to FPGA-based alternatives resulting in reduced Meantime Between Failure \(MTBF\).)
