153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 90 0 R
/E (The Valens VA7000 based on MIPI A-PHY, allows machine vision systems to reliably extend native CSI-2 data streams of 8 Gbps over a single coaxial cable for distances of up to 30 meters. Additionally, at reduced bandwidths cable length can be extended even further, giving factories the flexibility to place cameras based on operational needs rather than the location of processing units. This approach reduces the need for complicated wiring or additional hardware, helping lower installation costs and keeping system design less complex. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
