/S /H3
/P 96 0 R
/T (The first phase of the adoption strategy leverages bridge solutions that connect VA7000- based cameras to existing 10GigE IPC infrastructure. This approach enables organizations to capture MIPI A-PHY's benefits now, including smaller cameras, improved EMI resilience, and more flexible cabling, while maintaining compatibility with their current machine vision software platforms.)
